{"slug":"/references/medusa-workflows/updateRegionsWorkflow","title":"updateRegionsWorkflow - Medusa Core Workflows Reference","frontmatter":{"slug":"/references/medusa-workflows/updateRegionsWorkflow","sidebar_label":"updateRegionsWorkflow","sidebar_description":"Update regions.","tags":["region","payment","link","remote query","event bus","workflow","pricing"]},"toc":[{"title":"Examples","id":"examples","level":2},{"title":"Steps","id":"updateregionsworkflow-steps","level":2},{"title":"Input","id":"updateregionsworkflow-input","level":2},{"title":"Output","id":"updateregionsworkflow-output","level":2},{"title":"Emitted Events","id":"updateregionsworkflow-emitted-events","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This documentation provides a reference to the `updateRegionsWorkflow`. It belongs to the `@medusajs/medusa/core-flows` package."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"This workflow updates regions matching the specified filters. It's used by the\n[Update Region Admin API Route](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#regions\\_postregionsid).\n\nYou can use this workflow within your own customizations or custom workflows, allowing you\nto update regions in your custom flows."},{"kind":"sourceCodeLink","link":"https://github.com/medusajs/medusa/blob/b574ef20cbd58bc6a3361a3da969070e6ca97846/packages/core/core-flows/src/region/workflows/update-regions.ts#L41"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Examples","id":"examples"},{"kind":"codeTabs","tabs":[{"label":"API Route","language":"ts","title":"src/api/workflow/route.ts","code":"import type {\n  MedusaRequest,\n  MedusaResponse,\n} from \"@medusajs/framework/http\"\nimport { updateRegionsWorkflow } from \"@medusajs/medusa/core-flows\"\n\nexport async function POST(\n  req: MedusaRequest,\n  res: MedusaResponse\n) {\n  const { result } = await updateRegionsWorkflow(req.scope)\n    .run({\n      input: {\n        selector: {\n          id: \"reg_123\"\n        },\n        update: {\n          name: \"United States\"\n 